  "url": "https://jiga.io/about-us/",
  "publishedAt": "2026-04-23T12:02:44.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"13167\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\"> <div data-id=\"27d87b4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p data-id=\"cdc152d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"> <h2>Manufacturing deserves better</h2> </p> <p>We’re building tools that help NASA, Tesla, Google, and hundreds of top teams bring the future to life. Can you help us make it even better?</p> </div> <div data-id=\"36fc407\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"581\" src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-1024x744.webp\" alt=\"Jiga team members showcasing company culture, teamwork, and innovation in manufacturing technology\" srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-1024x744.webp 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-300x218.webp 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-150x109.webp 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-768x558.webp 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1.webp 1046w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20800%20581'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-1024x744.webp 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-300x218.webp 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-150x109.webp 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-768x558.webp 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1.webp 1046w\" data-lazy-src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Jiga-team-1-1024x744.webp\"> </p> </div> <div data-id=\"db07399\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\"> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"806\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Frame-2087325947.svg\" alt=\"Customer Logos\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20806%2080'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"> </p> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"454\" height=\"161\" src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Frame-2087325947-1.svg\" alt=\"Customer Logos\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20454%20161'%3E%3C/svg%3E\"> </p> </div> <div data-id=\"7a741ea\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p data-id=\"8a3d105\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"> <h2>Jiga What?</h2> </p> <div data-id=\"8b7b0d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <p>If you’re into engineering and building physical products, you probably know the sourcing grind. You email a few suppliers, wait days for quotes, answer the same questions twice (or ten times). Track everything in spreadsheets, deal with logistics, revisions, customs (you gotta love new tariffs every week), forms, reports and surprising delays.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It’s expensive, slow, tedious and painful – and it pulls you away from actual engineering work.</p>\n<p>Jiga fixes that. We connect engineers directly with vetted manufacturers, handle quoting and communication in one place, build AI workflows to deal with the administrative work, and give full visibility into every order from prototype into mass production. What used to take weeks now takes hours.</p>\n<p>We build the platform the manufacturing industry has been craving for years, and <b>we’re aiming for the moon</b>.</p> </div> </div> <div data-id=\"669e24e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-1024x819.webp\" alt=\"Jiga team working in a transparent and trust-based environment, showing a different way of doing business\" srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-1024x819.webp 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-300x240.webp 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-150x120.webp 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-768x614.webp 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1.webp 1250w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20800%20640'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-1024x819.webp 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-300x240.webp 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-150x120.webp 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-768x614.webp 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1.webp 1250w\" data-lazy-src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ADR_7858.JPG-1-1-1024x819.webp\"> </p> </div> <div data-id=\"482fdc4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p data-id=\"1fa3292\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"> <h2>We work differently</h2> </p> <p>Most companies talk about transparency and trust. <b>We actually do it.</b></p> </div> <div data-id=\"46087dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <div data-id=\"0573386\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <p><b>1. We share the numbers.</b><span> As a team member, you’ll see the full picture: revenue, valuation,&nbsp;</span>runway, roadmap, sales pipeline, what’s working and what fails.</p>\n<p><span>2. We have been remote and async</span>&nbsp;from day one and we&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/adarhay_want-to-work-remotely-or-hybrid-are-you-activity-7368637074180128770-eNiX/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">love it.</a>&nbsp;But we also love our team: once a year we bring everyone together to a small&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/yonatan-wolowelsky-2454553a_three-things-ive-learned-from-our-company-activity-7348002510021750785-sKHi?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAhAyBUBvHOWFVH-bfgbN4j46PscY5zN6zs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">offsite in paradise</a>&nbsp;for co-working, hiking, eating, drinking and sailing.</p>\n<p><span>3. We don’t count hours, we track performance.</span>&nbsp;You are senior enough to know what it means, we don’t need to explain.</p><p><b>4. We don’t do busy-work.</b> We meet for a weekly all-hands and a team sync. That’s it. Everything else is async. Your calendar will be empty to write code, talk to customers or to fix problems.</p>\n<p><b>5. We deliver&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.trustpilot.com/review/jiga.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">11/10 customer experience</a>.</b>&nbsp;We don’t settle for “good enough.” Quick response times, going the extra mile, creating fans not just users. It’s part of our DNA.</p> </div> <div data-id=\"abaa128\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <p><span>6. We decide fast.</span>&nbsp;The person closest to the problem makes the call.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/yonatan-wolowelsky-2454553a_when-we-started-jiga-we-made-one-decision-activity-7364299836977815552-nChi?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAhAyBUBvHOWFVH-bfgbN4j46PscY5zN6zs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">No approval chains</a>, no review committees and no endless layers of management.</p><p><span>7. Profitability is freedom.</span>&nbsp;We are cashflow positive,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7412100854398316544/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">growing revenue</a>&nbsp;by 3x YoY. No desperate fundraising, no panic pivots, no mass layoffs. The magic we’re building is being built to last for long time.</p><p><span>8. “Don’t drink the Kool-Aid”&nbsp;</span>is our motto. If you see something that needs fixing, it’s your duty to raise a flag or just fix it yourself.</p><p><span>9. We hire the best people.</span>&nbsp;We’ve gathered a super group of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7408893225760890880/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">best talents</a>&nbsp;in engineering, supply chain and sales. Everyone knows what they need to do and cruising through it.</p><p><b>10. Ship now, iterate later.</b>&nbsp;Perfection is the enemy of done. We’d rather learn from something that is live on production, than debate something theoretical.</p> </div> </div> <div data-wpr-lazyrender=\"1\" data-id=\"c849f0f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p data-id=\"e30b004\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <h4><b>Backed by</b></h4> </p> <p><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1024x134.png\" alt=\"Logos for Y Combinator, Aleph, and Symbol appear from left to right on a white background.\" srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1024x134.png 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-300x39.png 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-150x20.png 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-768x101.png 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1536x202.png 1536w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby.png 1989w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20800%20105'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1024x134.png 1024w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-300x39.png 300w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-150x20.png 150w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-768x101.png 768w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1536x202.png 1536w, https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby.png 1989w\" data-lazy-src=\"https://jiga.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/backedby-1024x134.png\"> </p> </div> <div data-wpr-lazyrender=\"1\" data-id=\"3f55022\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"open-positions\"> <p data-id=\"6903680\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"> <h2>Open Roles</h2> </p> <div data-id=\"8b1e75c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\"> <p><strong>Engineering</strong></p> <div> <p><i><span>Apply by sending: a short blurb&nbsp;</span></i><i><span>about yourself</span></i><i><span>, your LinkedIn, what excites you about Jiga and your fav ice cream</span></i></p>\n</div> </div> </div> <div data-wpr-lazyrender=\"1\" data-id=\"a28106a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\"> <p data-id=\"984a429\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"> <h2>How we talk about how we work</h2> </p> </div> </div></div>",
